# Keep GitHub's "Languages" bar representative of the Lean sources.
# docbuild/ is the documentation build (theme CSS, footer injection), not code.
docbuild/** linguist-documentation

# The Lax archive submissions under lax/ are exports of a tagged version of the
# library (concepts restating its definitions, the sliced proofs vendored in):
# they are read by the archive at a commit and a path, not from a release
# archive, so keep them out of the tarballs GitHub and Zenodo build.
lax/** export-ignore
